{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00491",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 2.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Morning! Make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.96,
      "end_seconds": 4.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.48,
      "end_seconds": 7.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Did the receptionist sort you out quickly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.52,
      "end_seconds": 11.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Yes, she was lovely about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.25,
      "end_seconds": 13.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.59,
      "end_seconds": 22.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.18,
      "text": "Um, mainly a fit last month. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.79,
      "end_seconds": 25.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.5,
      "end_seconds": 36.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "It's been going on for about four days. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.19,
      "end_seconds": 39.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Go on. And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.9,
      "end_seconds": 42.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.28,
      "end_seconds": 57.66,
      "duration_seconds": 14.38,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.34,
      "end_seconds": 62.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Right, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.3,
      "end_seconds": 68.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any loss of bladder control, fever or headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.82,
      "end_seconds": 71.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.53,
      "end_seconds": 74.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I see. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.48,
      "end_seconds": 81.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.47,
      "end_seconds": 86.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.7,
      "end_seconds": 87.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.38,
      "end_seconds": 102.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.9,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.31,
      "end_seconds": 105.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.07,
      "end_seconds": 112.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.38,
      "end_seconds": 117.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.98,
      "end_seconds": 130.45,
      "duration_seconds": 12.47,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.86,
      "end_seconds": 133.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.95,
      "end_seconds": 138.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.52,
      "end_seconds": 145.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, I have heart disease. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.76,
      "end_seconds": 147.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.92,
      "end_seconds": 151.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I had a bypass operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.01,
      "end_seconds": 154.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.8,
      "end_seconds": 160.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.36,
      "end_seconds": 164.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.78,
      "end_seconds": 173.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.29,
      "end_seconds": 193.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 97 percent, temperature is 36.6 degrees, BP is 125 over 82, respiratory rate 14, pulse is 81 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.02,
      "end_seconds": 196.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.72,
      "end_seconds": 199.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.29,
      "end_seconds": 204.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.11,
      "end_seconds": 205.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.43,
      "end_seconds": 231.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.4,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. So, based on your history, it fits best with breakthrough seizure on known epilepsy. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.41,
      "end_seconds": 236.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Uh, doctor, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.52,
      "end_seconds": 253.57,
      "duration_seconds": 17.05,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with breakthrough seizure on known epilepsy do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a fit last month for about four days, severe, and no fever or headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.31,
      "end_seconds": 257.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Hmm, exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.9,
      "end_seconds": 273.21,
      "duration_seconds": 14.31,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.33,
      "end_seconds": 278.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.3,
      "end_seconds": 299.85,
      "duration_seconds": 20.55,
      "text": "Let's get a blood level of the tablet, for adherence check. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. No driving until we've reviewed you again, I'm sorry, but that's the rule. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. We'll refer you to the epilepsy clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.14,
      "end_seconds": 312.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.32,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you have another seizure lasting more than five minutes. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.05,
      "end_seconds": 316.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Okay, so okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.12,
      "end_seconds": 323.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.2,
      "end_seconds": 329.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "So, um, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.63,
      "end_seconds": 335.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.23,
      "end_seconds": 339.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Yeah, no, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.79,
      "end_seconds": 341.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}